player recognise a film inside a non-commercial game. No claim of ownership is made, and
they are not redistributed at full resolution.

Posters and film metadata were retrieved from Wikipedia (https://www.wikipedia.org), whose
text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike License. The poster
images themselves are hosted on Wikipedia under a non-free fair-use rationale that applies
to Wikipedia's own use of them, not to third parties.

If you hold rights to any image here and want it removed, open an issue at
https://github.com/Endika/kartela/issues and it will be taken down.

